            "review_title": "Review at Yu Shang Lou - Fine Chinese Cuisine 2",
            "review_text": "Erin\n8 contributions\n0\nThe food was so amazing\nFeb 2019 • Family\nI came back to Vietnam this February, me and my family come here for Chinese food and enjoy the Chinese New year, then we have such a great time.\nThe food was so amazing (specially Dimsum), luxury space, great servers and the price is acceptable.\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 3, 2019",
